Haritica cloud GPL-extras image — license notes
================================================

This image is GPL-3.0-or-later as a whole (the aggregate work).

The verbatim GPL-3.0 license text is the file LICENSE.gpl-3.0.txt in this
directory; the Dockerfile COPYs it into the image at
/usr/share/haritica/LICENSE.

GPL-3 components included in this image:
  - HISAT2 v2.2.1                  (GPL-3.0-or-later)
  - subread / featureCounts v2.0.6 (GPL-3.0-or-later)
  - leidenalg                      (GPL-3.0-or-later)
  - louvain (vtraag/louvain-igraph) (GPL-3.0-or-later)
  - igraph (python bindings)       (GPL-2.0-or-later)

Permissively-licensed dependencies in the same image:
  - numpy, pandas, scipy           (BSD)
  - anndata, scanpy                (BSD)
  - boto3                          (Apache-2.0)
  - awscli                         (Apache-2.0)
  - samtools                       (MIT)

The thin wrapper scripts that aggregate the GPL-3 tools (entrypoint.sh,
run_alignment.py, run_clustering.py, Dockerfile) are Haritica-authored and
GPL-3.0-or-later.

See WRITTEN_OFFER.txt for source-access instructions per GPL-3 §6. The
corresponding source is published at
https://github.com/ThomasXielt/haritica-cloud-gpl-extras
